Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.28,0:00:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I look up to the stars\Nand reach for the sky….
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.76,0:00:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe in tomorrow if we try. I… Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.12,0:00:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.96,0:00:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we share the music.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.22,0:00:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We share the music.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.24,0:00:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go baby, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.92,0:00:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we share the one dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.58,0:00:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.86,0:00:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we share the good times.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.32,0:00:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We share the good times.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.54,0:00:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe, maybe, oh we share the one world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.50,0:00:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hard to see for you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.78,0:00:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Through the darkness\Nthat is in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.82,0:00:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So hard to see or to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.74,0:00:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,In where we need to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.56,0:00:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you and me, it's true that we.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.74,0:00:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Feel the rush brought up by this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.80,0:00:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Through head to feet, I feel the beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.78,0:00:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Getting me to walk on, oh yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.48,0:00:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the music, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.96,0:00:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the one dream, believe in yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.00,0:00:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the good times, take my hand now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.98,0:00:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the one world now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.46,0:00:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I look up to the stars\Nand reach for the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.40,0:01:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what, I'll\Ntry. No matter how high.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.80,0:01:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,So let us go beyond, far and wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.40,0:01:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe in tomorrow if we try.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.02,0:01:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.04,0:01:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.96,0:01:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we share the music.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.26,0:01:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We share the music.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.36,0:01:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go, baby, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.96,0:01:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we share the one world? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.96,0:01:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, as we chase, we're being chased?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.86,0:01:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,From the top we go on straight and wild!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.82,0:01:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We're on our way. I've got to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.82,0:01:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I want to share your style.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.54,0:01:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Now here it starts, so don't lose heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.78,0:01:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,They're bound to lose to this flavor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.68,0:01:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,From boot to hood, I feel so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.72,0:01:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I will be free to be, oh yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.46,0:01:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the music, even if I Share\Nthe laundry, I know where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.96,0:01:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the good times,\Nshare the one world now!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.44,0:01:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I look up to the stars\NAnd reach for the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.40,0:01:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what, I'll\Ntry no matter how high!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.76,0:01:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,So let us go Beyond far and wide I
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.84,0:02:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,believe in tomorrow If we try high
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.88,0:02:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.50,0:02:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,yeah I know that you are there Just on the
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.68,0:02:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,other side Wait there\Nfor me Soon it will be
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.82,0:02:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,you and I Then let us\Ngo Beyond far and wide
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.38,0:02:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe in the one world If we try high
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.96,0:02:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we share the music
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.80,0:02:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go, baby, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.94,0:02:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we share the one world
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.62,0:02:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Devil, I mean, handsome What do you\Nthink's taking the Straw Hat so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.14,0:02:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Pirates and Marines were\Nfighting like crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.16,0:02:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hope they didn't get caught in that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.16,0:02:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay sharp!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.40,0:02:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,With all of those idiots\Nrunning wild all over Sabo Odi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.84,0:02:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows if their ship will be safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.62,0:02:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why we've got to\Nguard it with our very lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.78,0:02:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Until the coding craftsman shows up\Nand takes over, don't budge and itch.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.26,0:03:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You got that, Rosie Life Riders?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.30,0:03:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger, Captain Handsome!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.86,0:03:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean you haven't caught them?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.52,0:03:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Admiral Kizaru is\Npursuing them as we speak,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.82,0:03:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,so I'm sure it's only a matter of\Ntime until they're captured, ma 'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.50,0:03:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You bunch of useless dogs!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.46,0:03:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only did you allow them\Nto do this to my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.62,0:03:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,and brother you also let\Nevery last one Of our
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.56,0:03:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,slaves escape and yet i\Nmust save my contempt for
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.68,0:03:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,the pirates who made a\Nmockery of Our bloodline when
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.86,0:03:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,you catch those heathens\Ni'll show them a true
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.90,0:03:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,living hell until they beg\Nfor Death on their knees i
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.14,0:03:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,have a bad feeling about\Nthis all of a sudden i sure
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.06,0:03:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,hope luffy chin and his\Nfriends are okay out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.60,0:03:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Kuma, don't say stuff like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.08,0:03:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just gonna stress everybody out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.22,0:03:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.26,0:03:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.26,0:03:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hats are tough, you know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.70,0:03:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.08,0:04:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.96,0:04:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You've seen how strong that guy is!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.88,0:04:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But not stronger than an admiral.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.54,0:04:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not saying that they'll lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.06,0:04:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But this will take more\Nthan just strength. You?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.42,0:04:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The seas ahead will be rough for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.10,0:04:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Filled with waves the likes\Nof which have never been
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.52,0:04:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Seen before and yet they must\Nwithstand them, ride them?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.28,0:04:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's quiet, but can you hear it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.10,0:04:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Little by little the tides are\Nchanging and the world with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.88,0:04:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,After being ejected from\NSabo Head, Monkey D.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.08,0:04:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy found himself on\Na very unique journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.84,0:04:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro! Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.64,0:04:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! Usam!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.76,0:04:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Soji Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.36,0:05:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Robin! Franky! Brooke! Everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.34,0:05:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.78,0:05:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys can't be dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.14,0:05:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit, there was nothing I could do.\NThat stupid warlord is gonna pay for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.50,0:05:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate this it sucks how\Nfar am I gonna fly anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.54,0:05:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh that could be good\Nnews maybe everyone didn't
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.18,0:05:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,disappear they're just\Nflying around like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.52,0:05:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Although three days of\Nthis sure will be boring
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.24,0:05:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,if I fall in the ocean\Nthat'll be the end of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.66,0:05:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so hungry, too. Screw this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.82,0:05:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.78,0:05:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,On and on he soared through starry skies.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.22,0:05:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, at long last...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.16,0:06:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.24,0:06:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.82,0:06:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't think my rubber\Npower saved me this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.58,0:06:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, what's this bear paw\Nlooking thing doing on the ground?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.20,0:06:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,If everyone else had a landing like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.24,0:06:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,They might be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.30,0:06:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh well, gotta get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.34,0:06:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.86,0:06:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And which way does the Sabaody\NArchipelago go from here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.84,0:06:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.92,0:06:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I have my Vibra card, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.54,0:06:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, good thing everyone got one, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.02,0:06:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.10,0:06:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Easy, follow the card.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.00,0:06:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be back together in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.94,0:06:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.38,0:07:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, start running\Nand look after yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.50,0:07:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't win this one!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.08,0:07:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We're too weak!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.86,0:07:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Get moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.80,0:07:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Just go! Get out of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.02,0:07:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We can figure out a plan once we're safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.32,0:07:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.18,0:07:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Why the hell am I so weak?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.92,0:07:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't save any of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.90,0:07:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.82,0:07:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, that didn't hurt that bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.06,0:07:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That rock's still in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.64,0:07:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,No doubt about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.18,0:07:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The card's pointing in that direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.40,0:07:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.78,0:07:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Giant pistol!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.00,0:08:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, I can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.60,0:08:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm all out of power.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.42,0:08:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I need food. Saji!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.76,0:08:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Who am I kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.88,0:08:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I know he's not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.68,0:08:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for all the food, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.98,0:08:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, that really brings me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.14,0:08:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa Garp used to throw me in the\Njungle all the time when I was a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.88,0:08:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, that kind of sucked.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.58,0:08:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, aren't these laughing mushrooms?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.10,0:08:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfect, this is just\Nwhat I need right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.46,0:08:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, now I'm having fun,\Neven though I'm all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.62,0:08:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh, these look weird. Let's try them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.54,0:09:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'm mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.52,0:09:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Laughing mushrooms, laughing mushrooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.58,0:09:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look, there's more over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.54,0:09:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, crying mushroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.48,0:09:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.50,0:09:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm right here, Sweet Pea.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.90,0:09:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you make of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.90,0:09:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.28,0:09:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Rather puzzling, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.80,0:09:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, this is terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.78,0:09:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I think this is a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.34,0:09:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Is she from the village?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.88,0:09:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.20,0:09:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,There are so many mushrooms growing\Nout of her body, I can't even tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.46,0:09:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.04,0:09:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Aha!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.44,0:09:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, look here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.35,0:09:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,This must be why she ate these.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.66,0:09:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,A parasitic mushroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.02,0:10:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,When you eat one, a whole sea of\Nthem pop up all over your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.12,0:10:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.68,0:10:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Or these mushrooms will sap away\Nall of her strength and she'll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.86,0:10:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Then make haste before all is lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.86,0:10:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Off Alondra, carry her to\Nthe village and quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.16,0:10:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.66,0:10:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay strong, small one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.14,0:10:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We will find aid. Let's hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.94,0:10:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We have an emergency!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.70,0:10:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.61,0:10:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Down in front!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.06,0:10:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't see!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.90,0:10:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness! Mushrooms! What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.54,0:10:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't seen that girl\Nin the village before.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.74,0:10:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.65,0:10:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.12,0:10:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.98,0:10:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,With all those mushrooms,\Nit's hard to tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.44,0:10:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Any idea where she came\Nfrom? Is she alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.38,0:10:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,She ate a parasitic mushroom, and now\Nthey're growing all over her body.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.68,0:10:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Belladonna, what do\Nyou think we should do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.52,0:10:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You can pull them off, but\Nwe have to get them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.28,0:10:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Be thorough. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.58,0:10:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,They come off?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.82,0:11:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.88,0:11:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But some of the bases are still stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.82,0:11:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.90,0:11:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of them later.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.52,0:11:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Just keep pulling.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.78,0:11:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,She's so odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.10,0:11:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure that this was wise?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.68,0:11:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.80,0:11:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.10,0:11:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.44,0:11:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on fire! Put me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.76,0:11:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.96,0:11:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Belladonna, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.08,0:11:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the only way to\Nkeep them from growing back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.06,0:11:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, it seems a bit excessive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.54,0:11:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,She passed out again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.84,0:11:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.22,0:11:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems she was covered in injuries\Nbefore she was covered in mushrooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.02,0:11:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,She was?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.58,0:11:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,She must have gone through\Nquite the terrible battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.20,0:11:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to treat her wounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.60,0:11:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Do me a favor, Margaret.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.12,0:11:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Take her down to the river\Nand give her a good bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.62,0:12:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.28,0:12:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.54,0:12:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it appears that she's\Nnot from the village after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.58,0:12:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,How strange. Yes. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.22,0:12:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on. What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.22,0:12:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's something wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.44,0:12:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been remiss in our\Nmushroom picking duties.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.14,0:12:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,There's one between our legs\Nthat we failed to catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.46,0:12:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,How careless of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.50,0:12:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.72,0:12:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But this one seems different\Nthan the others, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.00,0:12:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It has such a strange shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.38,0:12:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't come off, but\Nwhy hey, what's going
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.92,0:12:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,on it's stretching what is a mushroom?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.18,0:12:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough stop gawking ladies\Nthey aren't putting on a show for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.30,0:12:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If we leave so do you hey look that isn't
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.84,0:13:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,normal is it it's strange\Nshe's sort of rugged.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.42,0:13:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Not very well endowed, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.24,0:13:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.30,0:13:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my. What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.22,0:13:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.68,0:13:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hello, Granny Nyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.72,0:13:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a mushroom\Ngrowing on this girl that
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.80,0:13:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,won't come off no matter how hard we try.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.92,0:13:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.44,0:13:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But who is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.00,0:13:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.58,0:13:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This person is a...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.90,0:13:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a man! A man!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.14,0:13:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen a man before.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.70,0:13:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever shall I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.58,0:13:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Here lies the maiden\Nisland of Amazon Lily,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.28,0:13:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,inhabited by a tribe of female\Nwarriors known as the Kuja.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.80,0:14:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Woe be to the man who dreams of this\Nland. And woe be to the man who seeks
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.54,0:14:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,it For if they shall ever set foot\Nupon its soil Death surely awaits them
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.92,0:14:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the all-female land of Amazon Lily
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.52,0:14:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,where men dare not tread.\NOn occasion, the women
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.90,0:14:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,who live here will leave\Nthe island and return
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.14,0:14:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,with child but oddly enough they only seem
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.46,0:14:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,to give birth to girls here a thick jungle
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.38,0:14:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,surrounds a mountain that\Nstretches towards the
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.64,0:14:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,sky nestled inside its rocky exterior is a
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.04,0:14:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,fortress-like village that\Nhouses the entire nation
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.70,0:14:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a real disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.00,0:15:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Step right up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.26,0:15:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We got seeking, so get\Nit while it's fresh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.18,0:15:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That looks yummy, and it'll make\Nyour skin nice and soft too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.30,0:15:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Fresh-picked fruit from\Nthe jungle straight to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.12,0:15:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Fun-loving and hard-working, no job\Nis too challenging for these women.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.88,0:15:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Lock what I got!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.12,0:15:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That'll be perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.62,0:15:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Just set it down right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.22,0:15:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.70,0:15:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Raised from birth as warriors,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.62,0:15:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,they are as brave and\Nadventurous as any man,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.30,0:15:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,but have an undeniable grace about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.06,0:15:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Their seclusion has also given\Nthem an air of innocence.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.82,0:15:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Here in this paradise, there\Nis no need for men at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.60,0:15:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Because these women, above\Nall else, are strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.28,0:16:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Here are today's odds.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.44,0:16:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,A thousand gold on puppy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.32,0:16:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Fifteen hundred on candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.36,0:16:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,In this land,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.82,0:16:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,strength is beauty, and tempting\Nthough its lovely sights may be,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.50,0:16:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,any man foolish enough to gaze upon these\Nwarriors will not live to tell the tale.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.84,0:16:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The man is awake!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.66,0:16:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me see, let me see!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.42,0:16:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, we'll take turns!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.28,0:16:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He's moving around.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.50,0:16:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at his chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.84,0:16:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so flat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.14,0:16:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Awfully chiseled looking isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.42,0:16:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Rather underwhelming.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.52,0:16:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd say.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.43,0:16:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And his hair's so shaggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.98,0:16:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems like he was sleeping forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.94,0:16:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But I heard he was eating\Nwhile he was asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.36,0:16:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that a man?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.27,0:16:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.19,0:16:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it that men eat anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.46,0:16:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Just raw meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.58,0:17:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I get the feeling this\None will eat anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.78,0:17:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.38,0:17:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It sure is noisy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.66,0:17:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, he can talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.24,0:17:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hold on. Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.12,0:17:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And what the heck was I\Ndoing before I passed out?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.10,0:17:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.16,0:17:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We got split up and I\Nlanded someplace weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.72,0:17:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, he's saying something.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.02,0:17:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember eating some\Nmushrooms, but after that...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.30,0:17:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my hat's missing!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.34,0:17:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.25,0:17:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.17,0:17:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it back, you jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.94,0:17:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Weird!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.85,0:17:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Our bodies can't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.54,0:17:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.56,0:17:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That's better!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.78,0:17:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.14,0:17:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That means men can stretch their\Narms! Interesting! Very good!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.74,0:17:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Most intriguing indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.86,0:17:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, would you tell us your name, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.30,0:17:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.21,0:17:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.96,0:17:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.87,0:18:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,That's weird. I'm naked!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.98,0:18:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,We know!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.96,0:18:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's kind of breezy in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.96,0:18:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Anybody know where my stuff went?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.02,0:18:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Men are slow-witted,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.44,0:18:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,and they cover their heads first\Neven if their bodies are exposed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.46,0:18:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, pardon me for asking, but, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.02,0:18:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Before you get dressed,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.08,0:18:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,could you please tell us what's in that
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.34,0:18:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,little bag that's in\Nbetween your legs there?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.24,0:18:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Bag?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.60,0:18:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, you don't know what those are?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.34,0:18:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What a weirdo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.84,0:18:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,These are my family jewels.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.22,0:18:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,They're jewels?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.26,0:18:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,So what are these jewels?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.86,0:18:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.04,0:18:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I always gotta keep them safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.98,0:18:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Family jewels?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.02,0:18:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I had some too!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.70,0:18:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Then could you please take them out?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.48,0:18:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd just like to hold them for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.04,0:18:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you nuts?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.20,0:18:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.34,0:18:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.38,0:18:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Might as well get dressed, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.26,0:19:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Your clothes are all\Ntorn when we found you,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.20,0:19:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,so I made some new ones\Nthat are just like them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.38,0:19:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.29,0:19:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, thanks a lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.12,0:19:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That was real nice, and we\Ndon't even know each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.94,0:19:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,So flowery.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.14,0:19:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The vest says I'm serious,\Nbut the frilsy, I'm cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.36,0:19:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,His enemies will shake with\Nfear and jealousy alike.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.28,0:19:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a genius, Margaret.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.96,0:19:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, look, he's so happy he's shaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.62,0:19:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.92,0:19:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to make fun of me? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.22,0:19:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to attack. What\Nwhat a vicious temper
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.30,0:20:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,he shows his true nature\Nyou see my sisters even
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.70,0:20:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,after we save his life\Nhe turns on us growling
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.68,0:20:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,and snapping like the\Nbeast he is his temperament
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.12,0:20:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,is indeed savage his\Nwords and actions lack any
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.90,0:20:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,elegance whatsoever we\Nare incompatible with him
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.50,0:20:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,and every man even so\Nkey killer his offense
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.26,0:20:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,towards us is truly minor\Nwe need not kill him Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.08,0:20:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,before you guys shoot me, just a\Nsecond ago you said you saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.14,0:20:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.14,0:20:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't even know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.78,0:20:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You ate a bunch of parasitic\Nmushrooms and collapsed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.18,0:20:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you were found and\Nbrought here by these ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.30,0:20:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, that's what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.02,0:20:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.92,0:20:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry for flipping out and\Ncomplaining about the clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.46,0:20:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Just don't shoot me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.00,0:20:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Your apologies are meaningless.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.72,0:20:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Amazon Lily, female empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.68,0:20:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,All men are forbidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.20,0:20:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And for centuries now, we have\Nupheld this absolute rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.46,0:21:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You shall die like every man\Non this island before you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.52,0:21:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,No guys, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.22,0:21:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that we know your true nature,\Nwe have no sympathy for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.20,0:21:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.26,0:21:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I look, you are all girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.24,0:21:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, what a crazy country.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.72,0:21:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And still you prattle\Non, you ignorant worm!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.76,0:21:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.68,0:21:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Do we gotta kill him?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.04,0:21:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Aphalandra!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.14,0:21:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The snake princess will soon return.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.54,0:21:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you think she will feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.12,0:21:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,She would never approve of this situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.72,0:21:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You will also be charged with the crime\Nof bringing a man into the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.24,0:21:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Margaret.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.52,0:21:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Sweet Peep.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.24,0:21:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Aphalandra.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.60,0:21:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm doing this for your sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.00,0:21:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This incident?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.04,0:21:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,...must be kept secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.96,0:21:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on a sec!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.14,0:21:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you just let me go? My friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.72,0:21:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,They're waiting for me on Sabahori!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.50,0:21:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And I promised I would meet them there!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.02,0:22:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoot him!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.94,0:22:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Look up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.02,0:22:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He broke through the roof!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.08,0:22:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let him escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.84,0:22:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahhhhhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.00,0:22:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,My, my, he's a rather\Nnimble one, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.44,0:22:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Opal Island!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.72,0:22:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.26,0:22:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh well, I tried to save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.34,0:22:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He fell!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.88,0:22:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Now he's bouncing!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.64,0:22:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What should I do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.28,0:22:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I almost forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.92,0:22:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's my fever card?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.38,0:23:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I had it in the pocket of
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.30,0:23:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,my pants before I lost them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.08,0:23:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So, let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.60,0:23:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,There she is! Perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.64,0:23:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't talk in this crowd.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.26,0:23:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but there's\Nsomething I gotta ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.16,0:23:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.24,0:23:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That fiend, what does\Nhe want with Margaret?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.32,0:23:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.80,0:23:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you alright over\Nthere? Stay away from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.38,0:23:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,How how did you turn fat?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.38,0:23:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you out of your mind jumping from all\Nthe way up there human are monsters I?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.26,0:24:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't know what you did\Nor what you were thinking,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.82,0:24:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,but it's a miracle that we're still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.98,0:24:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.54,0:24:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.74,0:24:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard it said that all men have\Nsome sort of dangerous cootie virus.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.52,0:24:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that what caused you to\Ngrow so fat all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.44,0:24:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate to break it to you, but\NI don't think cooties are real.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.32,0:24:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And the fat thing is\Nkind of hard to explain,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.28,0:24:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,so let's just say that\Nyeah, all guys turn fat.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.90,0:24:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, there was something I left in\Nthe pocket of my old pair of pants.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.72,0:24:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you still have it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.82,0:24:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.30,0:24:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, I was so worried!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.80,0:24:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what I would\Nhave done if I'd lost it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.54,0:24:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.64,0:24:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a real lifesaver.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.90,0:24:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Get your hands off me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.04,0:24:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay put. You're mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.32,0:24:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Something was written on it,\Nso I kept it just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.40,0:24:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.40,0:25:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,How unusual.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.44,0:25:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like it's moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.94,0:25:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,A bunch of stuff happened,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.72,0:25:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,and then all my friends went flying\Nthrough the air in different directions.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.50,0:25:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But now, with this piece of paper, I can\Nfind my way back to them wherever they go.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.32,0:25:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,They're strong, so I'm not worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.72,0:25:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, guess I should pay\Nyou back for all your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.06,0:25:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,If there's anything I\Ncan do for you, just ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.10,0:25:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, there is!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.22,0:25:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you take out your family\Njewels so I can see them?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.54,0:25:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not even funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.70,0:25:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.96,0:25:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Just put the sword down and\Nleave my jewels alone, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.60,0:25:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,These friends of yours,\Nwho are they exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.86,0:25:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, well, we're all a pirate crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.92,0:25:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know what pirates are here?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.26,0:25:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.96,0:25:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, the empress of this\Ncountry is a pirate as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.18,0:26:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.38,0:26:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you guys have like\Nan all-girl pirate crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.28,0:26:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Are they strong?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.28,0:26:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What a foolish question. Only the most\Nelite warriors are allowed to ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.84,0:26:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,aboard the pirate ship of our empress\Nso yes of course they're strong
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.76,0:26:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,in this proud nation all of the women\Nlook up to the snake princess her beauty
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.18,0:26:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,is unparalleled she's strong and noble\Nshe's called the pirate empress boa
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.34,0:26:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hancock she and her sisters are the\Nprotectors of this island and well truth
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.70,0:26:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,be told they're
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.68,0:26:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Our heroes, oh no, the
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.52,0:26:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,ship of the snake princess is nearly here
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.18,0:26:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,curses this isn't good we\Nmust deal with the man quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.44,0:27:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,kinkyo he jumped over the wall and disappeared\Nwhat should we do now warriors to the
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.64,0:27:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,jungle we will rescue\Nmargaret then put the
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.12,0:27:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,man to death the snake\Nprincess has returned
